{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"aa365953ef6c4d7eb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 SAT solver inprocessing 技术（vivification、bounded variable elimination、subsumption、self-subsuming resolution、blocked clause elimination）的最新进展，看 OR-Tools CP-SAT 用了哪些、还能加什么。\n\n**背景：** Round 5/6/7 调研了 CP-SAT 参数和 9.16 新参数。但 inprocessing 是 SAT 内部的\"周期性化简\"，2024-2026 学术界仍有进展。CP-SAT 9.15 的 inprocessing 包到什么程度，能不能调更激进。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. 主流 inprocessing 技术（2024-2026 论文）\n2. CaDiCaL 2.x / Kissat 4.x 的 inprocessing 列表\n3. CP-SAT inprocessing 相关参数（inprocessing_dtime_ratio 等）\n4. CP-SAT 是否实现 vivification / SAT sweeping\n5. inprocessing 调激进的风险\n\n输出末尾：\"我们能调哪些参数加强 inprocessing\"。"},"uuid":"99007c1a-1742-465a-967a-cf967bb291ec","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:06:46.684Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
