{"parentUuid":"c64d909f-fabb-49f2-8a29-6859c8208af8","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa365953ef6c4d7eb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Na65dMdHtTHFsD8ZV2p3si","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016M75zgfhBsy8M7BWQ64TcZ","name":"Glob","input":{"pattern":"**/sat_parameters.proto"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":277,"cache_read_input_tokens":36857,"output_tokens":75,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":277},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":75,"cache_read_input_tokens":36857,"cache_creation_input_tokens":277,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":277,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoyFeCVMVsureRyTUo5S","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a546254e-afad-46ba-8ab5-b1415f304a30","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:08:07.067Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a546254e-afad-46ba-8ab5-b1415f304a30","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b55e8deb-71cd-4096-967c-371d63aeb2d3","agentId":"aa365953ef6c4d7eb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016M75zgfhBsy8M7BWQ64TcZ","type":"tool_result","content":"No files found"}]},"uuid":"77277c84-ded3-49c0-8b83-0ac3ca994fbd","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:08:07.101Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a546254e-afad-46ba-8ab5-b1415f304a30","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"77277c84-ded3-49c0-8b83-0ac3ca994fbd","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa365953ef6c4d7eb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_015CYZetCaK2xFDedo2RmT3K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本地没有源码。基于 web 调研，整合输出。\n\n---\n\n# SAT Inprocessing 调研：CP-SAT 的\"周期化简\"还能调多狠\n\n## 1. 主流 inprocessing 技术（2024-2026）\n\n学术界 inprocessing 五大件加上近年新成员：\n\n- **Vivification（子句活化）**：用单元传播逐字面试探，删除学习子句里的冗余字面，提升 BCP 效果。2019 年起成为 CDCL 标配，2025 年仍在演进（并行 vivification 线程）。\n- **Bounded Variable Elimination (BVE)**：消变量+做 resolvent，受 occurrence 阈值约束。2023 年 HAL 论文提出新变量序 ESA，在 2022 之前所有 SAT 比赛实例上稳定提升基础求解器。\n- **Subsumption / Self-Subsuming Resolution**：删被包含的子句，或用 resolvent 缩短子句。\n- **Blocked Clause Elimination (BCE)**：所有 resolvent 是 tautology 时删子句。\n- **Congruence Closure + Gate Extraction**（2024 SAT 新热点）：Kissat 在 2024 比赛拿 3 金，核心就是这个。CaDiCaL 2025 把它从 Kissat 移植回来，代码量从 46K 涨到 64K。\n- **Clausal Equivalence Sweeping (SAT Sweeping)**（FMCAD'24）：用 SAT 调用检测变量等价类。\n- **Bounded Variable Addition (BVA)**：与 BVE 反着来，引入新变量压缩长子句模式。\n\n## 2. CaDiCaL 2.x / Kissat 4.x 的 inprocessing 列表\n\nCaDiCaL 2.0 (CAV'24) 的 `cdcl_loop_with_inprocessing` 把 CDCL 主循环和化简交错跑。2025 版从 Kissat 端口了：congruence closure、gate extraction、BVA（内部版）、SAT sweeping、vivification。Kissat 还多一个比 CaDiCaL 更激进的调度策略（`scheduling of inprocessing`）。\n\n## 3. CP-SAT 的 inprocessing 参数清单（基于 sat_parameters.proto stable 分支）\n\n**inprocessing 主开关组（运行中周期化简）：**\n\n| 参数 | 默认 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `use_sat_inprocessing` | true | 总开关 |\n| `inprocessing_dtime_ratio` | 0.2 | inprocessing 占 dtime 比例上限 |\n| `inprocessing_probing_dtime` | 1.0 | 每轮 probing 预算 |\n| `inprocessing_minimization_dtime` | 1.0 | 每轮子句最小化预算 |\n| `inprocessing_minimization_use_conflict_analysis` | true | 最小化用冲突分析 |\n| `inprocessing_minimization_use_all_orderings` | **false** | 试所有变量序（更激进但慢） |\n| `inprocessing_use_congruence_closure` | true | 同余闭包 |\n| `inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping` | **false** | SAT sweeping（默认关） |\n\n**presolve（启动前一次性）：**\n\n| 参数 | 默认 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `presolve_bve_threshold` | 500 | BVE 占用积阈值 |\n| `presolve_bve_clause_weight` | 3 | BVE 权重 |\n| `presolve_blocked_clause` | true | BCE |\n| `presolve_use_bva` | true | BVA |\n| `presolve_bva_threshold` | 1 | BVA 触发阈值 |\n| `max_presolve_iterations` | 3 | presolve 迭代上限 |\n| `presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit` | 30.0 | presolve 阶段 probing 时长 |\n| `presolve_inclusion_work_limit` | 1e8 | subsumption 工作量上限 |\n\n**subsumption / vivification：**`subsumption_during_conflict_analysis`、`extra_subsumption_during_conflict_analysis`、`eagerly_subsume_last_n_conflicts=4`、`subsume_during_vivification=true`。CP-SAT 没有独立 `vivification_dtime` 参数，活化嵌在 inprocessing minimization 里。\n\n## 4. CP-SAT 实现了哪些 / 缺哪些\n\n- **实现了**：BVE、BVA、BCE、subsumption、self-subsuming（在 minimization 内）、probing、congruence closure、SAT sweeping（关闭中）、vivification（隐式，在 minimization 里 + `subsume_during_vivification`）。\n- **没有独立暴露**：vivification 没有专门的 dtime 旋钮，调度是隐式的；2024 学术界的 ESA 变量序 BVE 没出现在参数里；Kissat 的 gate extraction 在 CP-SAT 是 `inprocessing_use_congruence_closure` 一并打包，不能单独拉激进度。\n\n## 5. 调激进的风险\n\n- **BVE 反向放大**：BVE 是少数会让公式\"变难\"的化简，阈值（`presolve_bve_threshold`）拉高可能让 resolvent 爆炸，子句数量翻倍后 BCP 反而变慢。SAT 文献明确警告。\n- **inprocessing 抢 dtime**：`inprocessing_dtime_ratio` 从 0.2 拉到 0.4+，搜索时间被吃掉，对已经接近最优的 instance 拖慢收敛。\n- **all_orderings + sweeping**：`inprocessing_minimization_use_all_orderings=true` + `inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping=true` 在大模型上单轮 inprocessing 可能跑几十秒，如果模型快就解了反而亏。\n- **probing 时间炸**：`presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit=30` 已经偏高，再拉到 60-120 在 70x70 的 master 上可能让 presolve 阶段卡 1-2 分钟。\n- **不影响正确性**：所有 inprocessing 都是保等价变换，激进只影响速度不影响正确性 —— 这点对项目 `certified_exact` 友好。\n\n---\n\n## 我们能调哪些参数加强 inprocessing\n\n**保守激进（建议先试）：**\n1. `inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping = true` — 默认关的，对几何/对称结构常有奇效\n2. `inprocessing_minimization_use_all_orderings = true` — 默认关\n3. `presolve_bva_threshold = 0` — 更激进的 BVA（默认 1）\n4. `max_presolve_iterations = 5`（默认 3）\n\n**中度激进（需 worker matrix 实验）：**\n5. `inprocessing_dtime_ratio = 0.3-0.4`（默认 0.2）\n6. `inprocessing_probing_dtime = 2.0`（默认 1.0）\n7. `inprocessing_minimization_dtime = 2.0`（默认 1.0）\n8. `presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit = 60.0`（默认 30）\n9. `presolve_inclusion_work_limit = 5e8`（默认 1e8）\n\n**慎调（可能反效果）：**\n10. `presolve_bve_threshold = 1000-2000`（默认 500） — 注意子句爆炸\n11. `presolve_bve_clause_weight = 2`（默认 3，降权 = 更愿意 BVE）\n\n**S6 worker matrix 落地建议**：留 1-2 个 profile 设为 `aggressive_inprocessing`，开 1+2+3+5+6+7，对照默认 profile 跑 168h 子集，看 dtime 占比和 best-bound 收敛速度。SAT sweeping 默认关说明 Google 没把它当万金油 —— 视场景再开。\n\nSources:\n- [CP-SAT sat_parameters.proto (stable)](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [CaDiCaL 2.0 (CAV'24)](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFazekasFleuryFroleyksPollitt-CAV24-Springer.pdf)\n- [CaDiCaL/Kissat at SAT Competition 2025](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFleuryFroleyksPollitt-SAT-Competition-2025-solvers.pdf)\n- [CaDiCaL/Kissat at SAT Competition 2024](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFazekasFleuryFroleyksPollitt-SAT-Competition-2024-solvers.pdf)\n- [A New Variable Ordering for In-processing BVE (HAL 2023)](https://hal.science/hal-04145361v1/file/A_New_Variable_Ordering_for_In_processing_Bounded_Variable_Elimination_in_SAT_Solvers.pdf)\n- [Preprocessing in SAT Solving (Handbook 2021)](https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereJarvisaloKiesl-SAT-Handbook-2021-Preprocessing-Chapter-Manuscript.pdf)\n- [Streamlining Distributed SAT Solver Design (SAT'25)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol341-sat2025/html/LIPIcs.SAT.2025.27/LIPIcs.SAT.2025.27.html)\n- [CP-SAT Primer Parameters](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":90,"cache_read_input_tokens":37134,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":90,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoyFrMyWajYbVJkKQ5Kh","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad94e620-85fb-4d10-98bf-56cd66fea449","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:09:01.808Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
